          <p class="pgh" style="margin-top:26px">It listens. It remembers. It asks. It nudges.</p><div class="pgid"><span class="hnd">/ravikumar</span><i></i><span>CP · 4417</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="leaf" id="dcLeaf4" style="z-index:20"><div class="lf"><span class="pglbl">PAGE 08 / A STAMP IS EARNED</span>
          <p class="pgh" style="margin:auto 0;text-align:center">Evidence that demonstrates real depth<br>earns a signal that carries forward.</p><div class="pgid"><span class="hnd">/ravikumar</span><i></i><span>CP · 4417</span></div></div><div class="lb"><span class="pglbl">PAGE 09 / THE RECORD SO FAR</span>
          <p class="pgh" style="margin-top:6px">Every entry stays where you put it. Nothing here can be edited by anyone else.</p><div class="pgid"><span class="hnd">/ravikumar</span><i></i><span>CP · 4417</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="leaf" id="dcLeaf3" style="z-index:30"><div class="lf"><span class="pglbl">PAGE 06 / A CURATED JOURNEY</span>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div class="jrow"><b>1</b><span>Revisit the failure timeline you kept at the time.</span></div><div class="jrow"><b>2</b><span>Explain the call you made under load.</span></div><div class="jrow"><b>3</b><span>Show the fix, and how you proved it held.</span></div></div>
